/* "Olive Stone" theme: tokens and shared look (docs/dev/ui-design.md). RCSS has no variables, so the
   token values are repeated here and in the documents that need them:
     panel-fill #282f26   panel-stroke #626d50   button-fill #3d4736   button-stroke #c8af77
     icon #c5c7b5         text-primary #eee8d8   text-secondary #a0ad8b
   The layout is drawn for a 1920x1080 screen: 1dp = 1 design pixel (the application scales dp by window height). */

/* RmlUi has no user-agent stylesheet: block-level elements must be declared. */
div, p, h1, h2, h3 {
    display: block;
}

/* A document body covers the whole screen: it must not swallow the mouse meant for the map or for windows
   below it. pointer-events is inherited, so every interactive block opts back in (.panel and .interactive). */
body {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    font-family: "PT Sans Caption";
    font-size: 14dp;
    color: #eee8d8;
    pointer-events: none;
}

.interactive {
    pointer-events: auto;
}

.panel {
    pointer-events: auto;
    background-color: #282f26;
    border: 1dp #626d50;
    border-radius: 2dp;
}

.heading {
    font-family: "PT Serif";
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #eee8d8;
}

.muted {
    color: #a0ad8b;
}
